  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Automate or Adjudicate Insurance Claims",
    "splashDescription": "Claims management is incredibly common but often expensive to process without automation. The personal insurance claim process blueprint provides a foundation to streamline the handling of high-volume, low-value claims, reducing delays and improving customer satisfaction. By automating key steps and providing decision insights to adjusters, this blueprint ensures quicker, more accurate claim resolutions, helping to prevent fraud and enhance overall efficiency.",
